<title>USA: Moore Products names Edward Hurd chair.</title>
<headline>Moore Products names Edward Hurd chair.</headline>
<dateline>SPRING HOUSE, Pa. 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moore Products Co said Thursday Edward Hurd had been elected board chairman.</p>
<p>Hurd joined the board in June.</p>
<p>A statement from the company said Hurd will direct policy and provide strategic leadership.  </p>
<p>Moore said Hurd has 35 years of global process control experience and had served as president of Industrial Control, a business operation of Honeywell Inc, from 1990 to 1995.</p>
